# AnyMCP

> A catalog of MCP servers that are each one C# file. You download the file, and you point
> your MCP client at `dotnet run <file>.cs -v q`. There is no project file, no build step of
> your own, and no container. The only prerequisite is the .NET 10 SDK.

- Read {{ site.url }}/install.md one time. The procedure is the same for every server.
- Each server has a machine-readable page. Fetch the `.md`, and not the HTML.
- The whole catalog as JSON: {{ site.url }}/servers.json

